	(label "GND"
		(at 215.9 88.9 270)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify right bottom)
		)
		(uuid "a32d25cc-0d18-d928-eaac-d72ec0325500")
	)
	(text "WIRE BY PIN NAME, NEVER BY NUMBER. On this symbol pin NUMBER 26 is the pin NAMED P32 - numbers are header positions. Verify every net against the pad number in docs/pinmap.md after layout; ERC will not catch it."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 170.18 25.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "32fb1180-8424-9f45-9858-a913788c207c")
	)
	(text "FLASH PINS - NPTH, NO COPPER: pins 17,18,19,35,36 (SD1,SD0,CLK,SD2,SD3) are the internal SPI flash bus, GPIO6-11. Holes with no pad. Do NOT delete the holes or the module cannot seat."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 170.18 33.02 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "acba12c5-f40e-50d0-0170-185a80843e6d")
	)
	(text "34/35/36/39 (pins 24,25,22,23) are INPUT ONLY with NO internal pull-up. Every button and sensor on them needs an external 10k to 3V3 or it floats and reads randomly."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 170.18 40.64 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "898a291b-8fb5-2d49-8565-d4a957c1ad90")
	)
	(text "GND IS DC-. The controller floats with the bus. No USB while energised; no earthed scope ground clip - differential probe or a non-contact pickup loop only."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 170.18 48.26 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b9a36bd9-128c-f876-027c-2ed7643bc975")
	)
	(text "SSR-100DD input 3-32V from +12V, Q1 low-side. P4 delivers the voltage STEP (CR-05); the AC contactor never does - a Royer fed a slow ramp shoots through and kills the IRFP260Ns."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 170.18 55.88 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "eeeb1f9e-9e3f-8f8c-431b-6f7f00786ab3")
	)
	(text "LAMPS ARE NOT ON THE MCU. Three 12V panel lamps hang off a PCF8574 (J13) via 2N7002 MOSFETs. The expander sources only ~100uA when high, which is too little for a 2N3904 base - a MOSFET gate is voltage-driven and does not care."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 170.18 63.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "633fc3c8-6454-9af1-24de-bae3ac77300b")
	)
	(text "MAINS START IS NOT HERE. It is hardwired in the contactor coil circuit (requirements 6.9) and must never reach the MCU: firmware must not be able to energise mains by itself."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 170.18 71.12 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "12c3558f-848f-4541-9a83-c7402e13d56b")
	)
	(text "Bus voltage now comes from the INA228 (J10), not a discrete divider. The old 220k/10k and its filter cap are deleted."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 170.18 78.74 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "7e5c47c3-e7ff-c2ce-c2d4-4721ef1a1ef5")
	)
	(text "SPARE: P25 (28), P26 (29), P27 (30) - freed by moving lamps to the expander. P0/P2/P12 are strapping pins, usable only with care."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 170.18 86.36 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "2ba66d48-15d0-27f7-1ba2-1fb9639cce37")
	)
